&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #FDF6D7;padding: 3px;&quot;&gt;►►►► I love the raw potential of a new object. We haven&#039;t had one in &lt;em&gt;ages.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; background-color: #F6D9E1;padding: 3px;&quot;&gt;►►►►► Start us off, then. Do the header.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
