&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; width: 100%; padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container floatright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5751/Bright.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Bright.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; One damaged, rewritable Blu-Ray disc in the collection of Dr. J. Bright, Director of Foundation Personnel, containing [DATA EXPUNGED].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Bright expressed satisfaction at the return of his files, remarking &amp;quot;I thought I&#039;d lost these forever!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding-right: 12px; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 24px;background-color: #F3F3F3&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Eureka. Time to whip up a few proposals.&lt;/em&gt; [Sokolsky, Dr. D.]&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding-right: 12px; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 36px;background-color: #F3F3F3&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I&#039;ll be waiting.&lt;/em&gt; [Light, Dir. S.]&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding-right: 12px; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 48px;background-color: #F3F3F3&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I was hoping you&#039;d both forgotten about this.&lt;/em&gt; [Blank, Dr. H.]&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:3px; margin-top: 3px; width: 100%&quot;&gt;
