&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION EMERGENT THREAT TACTICAL RESPONSE AUTHORITY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container floatright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5751/Asterisk.png&quot; alt=&quot;Asterisk.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SCP-5751 database file and all information pertaining thereto are now under the exclusive purview of this office. Please direct all enquiries or proposals for experimental applications to Dr. Daniil Sokolsky at Site-43.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8212; Dr. Daniel ███████, Director, ETTRA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-564304-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Cernunnos-class objects can be contained by the Foundation, but the measures required to do so are impractical.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-564304-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. See database entries for SCP-5751-1 and SCP-5751-5958 below for the evidence behind this assertion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5750&quot;&gt;SCP-5750&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5751 | &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5752&quot;&gt;SCP-5752&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608041824&quot; alt=&quot;HarryBlank&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank&quot;  &gt;HarryBlank&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
