&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595130-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Fifth stage discolouration has been determined via autopsy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595130-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. In &lt;em&gt;Fifty Thousand Words to Defeat the Red Menace,&lt;/em&gt; a mass market paperback novel published in 1971 supposedly capable of &amp;quot;defusing the threat to international life and liberty currently festering behind the Iron Curtain&amp;quot; if read.&lt;/div&gt;
