&lt;div class=&quot;image-container aligncenter&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/ProjectHeca&quot; height=&quot;25px&quot; width=&quot;25px&quot; alt=&quot;ProjectHeca&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Judith,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I’ve run into something I could use your expertise on. I know you primarily focus your research on the Nälkä, but how much do you know about Daeva occult practices? If you can point me in the direction of an expert, or provide some insight yourself, I would be in your debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iona Varga, MD/PhD&lt;br /&gt;
Director of Site-91&lt;/p&gt;
